sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Handler as PlanRemoteItemsHandler
    participant Service as RemotePlannerService
    participant Adapter as TodoApiClient
    participant Client as HttpApiClient
    participant API as Todo API, or its emulator with TODO_API_HOST=mock

    Handler->>+Service: PlanAsync(titles, token)
    Service->>+Adapter: PlanItemsAsync(titles, token)
    Adapter->>+Client: CallAsync of POST /v1/items/plan
    Note over Client: the operation is in the adapter's list, the client middleware run around each attempt
    Note over Client: record "http client request sent"
    Client->>+API: POST /v1/items/plan, JSON, X-Request-Id, within TODO_API_TIMEOUT
    API-->>-Client: answer, or none
    Note over Client: record "http client response received"
    Client-->>-Adapter: the answer, or throws ApiUnavailableException or ApiStatusException
    Adapter-->>-Service: TodoApiItem list, or the exception
    Note over Service: ApiUnavailableException: kind Unavailable. Code InvalidArgument: kind Invalid. Anything else: no kind
    Service-->>-Handler: Item list, or an exception
